<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px; font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:22px; font-weight:700; color:#18181b; line-height:1.3;">
  Your password was changed
</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 12px; font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#3f3f46;">
  Hi <%= firstname %>,
</p>
<p style="margin:0 0 4px; font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:15px; line-height:1.6; color:#3f3f46;">
  This is a confirmation that your account's password was just changed. Every other active session was signed out as a result.
</p>

<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="background-color:#fef2f2; border:1px solid #fecaca; border-radius:10px; margin-top:16px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="padding:14px 18px; font-family:'Inter', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:13px; line-height:1.6; color:#991b1b;">
      If you didn't make this change, contact your administrator immediately.
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>
